# E-Invoice module – English
Module500220Name = E-Invoice
Module500220Desc = Fetch e-invoices (XRechnung, ZUGFeRD/Factur-X) from a mailbox
Module500220DescLong = Fetches incoming e-invoices from a mailbox (Microsoft 365 via Graph or any IMAP server), detects XRechnung (CII/UBL) and ZUGFeRD/Factur-X and creates supplier invoices from them.
